 is moving from primarily manual financial-statement review toward data-driven and AI-assisted underwriting."},{"type":"p","text":"Important emerging skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Machine-learning credit scoring"},{"text":"Alternative data analysis"},{"text":"Explainable AI"},{"text":"Automated underwriting"},{"text":"Real-time credit assessment"},{"text":"Open-banking data"},{"text":"Cash-flow underwriting"},{"text":"Fraud detection"},{"text":"Behavioural analytics"},{"text":"AI model validation"},{"text":"Model governance"},{"text":"Credit portfolio analytics"},{"text":"Climate-risk analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, human judgement will remain important for complex corporate lending, unusual financial situations, model validation, risk appetite, regulatory decisions, and responsible lending."},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Outlook"},{"type":"p","text":"Routine credit checks, data extraction, ratio calculation, and preliminary scoring will increasingly be automated."},{"type":"p","text":"Higher-value professionals will focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI credit strategy"},{"text":"Model governance"},{"text":"Complex credit assessment"},{"text":"Portfolio risk"},{"text":"Stress testing"},{"text":"Responsible AI"},{"text":"Financial inclusion"},{"text":"Alternative-data strategy"},{"text":"Credit policy"},{"text":"Risk architecture"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential future roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Credit Risk Strategist"},{"text":"Credit Data Scientist"},{"text":"AI Underwriting Specialist"},{"text":"Credit Model Governance Manager"},{"text":"Digital Lending Risk Manager"},{"text":"Predictive Credit Strategist"},{"text":"AI Risk Manager"},{"text":"Credit Analytics Director"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Financial Statements"},{"text":"Corporate Finance"},{"text":"Financial Modelling"},{"text":"Financial Markets"}]},{"t